    "traits": "Aura, Enchantment, Fear",
    "description": "<p>You emanate an aura of fear similar to that of a dragon. At the beginning of their turn, each creature within the radius of the spell must make a saving throw with the following results:</p>\n<p><strong>Critical</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is frightened 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Partial</strong> The creature is frightened 2.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is frightened 3 and fleeing for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Fumble</strong> The creature is frightened 4 and fleeing until the frightened condition is removed.</p>\n<p><strong>Blunder</strong> The creature is frightened 5 and gains the paralyzed condition until the frightened condition is removed.</p>\n<p>Be aware that regardless of the result of the saving throw, the creature is temporarily immune to this spell for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><em>Partly automated:</em> the creatures targeted when you cast save, and their conditions are applied. Later saves at the start of each creature's turn, the 1-minute immunity, and ending Fleeing or Paralyzed with Frightened are by hand.</p>"
  },
